{"id":"a5a69b9a2969217e","group":"93","path":"93/93-thm-congruence-lattice.md","title":"thm-congruence-lattice","display":"thm-congruence-lattice","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","depends_on":["[[93-df-congruence]]","[[93-df-congruence-lattice]]","[[93-df-congruence-modular]]","[[93-df-modular-lattice]]"],"display":"thm-congruence-lattice","label":"93-thm-congruence-lattice","aliases":["93-thm-congruence-lattice"],"type":"theorem"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"30b341bfbd8b5301\" href=\"?note=30b341bfbd8b5301\" title=\"93-df-congruence\">93-df-congruence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"135c0cfcbae1f3c5\" href=\"?note=135c0cfcbae1f3c5\" title=\"93-df-congruence-lattice\">93-df-congruence-lattice</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c8ff2f79b6a4018b\" href=\"?note=c8ff2f79b6a4018b\" title=\"93-df-congruence-modular\">93-df-congruence-modular</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ad379574ef6f3a71\" href=\"?note=ad379574ef6f3a71\" title=\"93-df-modular-lattice\">93-df-modular-lattice</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-congruence-lattice"},{"key":"label","html":"93-thm-congruence-lattice"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-thm-congruence-lattice</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-congruence-lattice-thm-congruence-lattice\">thm-congruence-lattice <code>thm-congruence-lattice</code></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CongMod}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{CongMod}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConLat}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{ConLat}_{93}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ModularLat}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{ModularLat}_{93}\\)</span> are the constructors/predicates of the cited definitions.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}congruence\\text{-}lattice}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CongMod}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\to\n\\forall\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal V\\;\n\\mathrm{ModularLat}_{93}(\\mathrm{ConLat}_{93}(\\mathbf A))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}congruence\\text{-}lattice}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CongMod}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\to\n\\forall\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal V\\;\n\\mathrm{ModularLat}_{93}(\\mathrm{ConLat}_{93}(\\mathbf A))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Congruence lattices are complete algebraic lattices in general, but they are modular only under the congruence-modularity hypothesis on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-congruence-lattice-thm-congruence-lattice","text":"thm-congruence-lattice `thm-congruence-lattice`","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-congruence","status":"resolved","id":"30b341bfbd8b5301","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-congruence]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-congruence-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"135c0cfcbae1f3c5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-congruence-lattice]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-congruence-modular","status":"resolved","id":"c8ff2f79b6a4018b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-congruence-modular]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-modular-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"ad379574ef6f3a71","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-modular-lattice]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{CongMod}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ConLat}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ModularLat}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}congruence\\text{-}lattice}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CongMod}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\to\n\\forall\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal V\\;\n\\mathrm{ModularLat}_{93}(\\mathrm{ConLat}_{93}(\\mathbf A))","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal V","display":false}],"bytes":905,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["30b341bfbd8b5301","135c0cfcbae1f3c5","c8ff2f79b6a4018b","ad379574ef6f3a71"]}